text-align: center; color: green\"><b>Good</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Terra Boots\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Terra_Boots_d9273f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Iron%20Ore\"><img alt=\"Iron Ore\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Iron_Ore_676164.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarven%20Ring\"><img alt=\"Dwarven Ring\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dwarven_Ring_67bdd7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Sapphire\"><img alt=\"Small Sapphire\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Small_Sapphire_dd1560.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Amethyst\"><img alt=\"Small Amethyst\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Small_Amethyst_8b8d7c.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.20<br/>July 2, 2008<br/>Summer Update 2008</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nThe <a href=\"#/wiki/Tiquanda\">Tiquanda</a> Dwarf Cave is located in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Tiquanda\">Tiquanda</a> jungle, between <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope\">Port Hope</a>, the entrance is located here: \n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 156px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"Dwarf Cave entrance\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"182\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tiquanda_Dwarf_cave_entrance1_c0e1ab.jpg\" width=\"156\"/>  <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> <p class=\"caption\">Dwarf Cave entrance</p> </figcaption> </figure>\n<p>On the way to the entrance you will meet:<br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Snake\">Snakes</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Bat\">Bats</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Bug\">Bugs</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Wasp\">Wasps</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Elephant\">Elephants</a> and possible 1 lured <a href=\"#/wiki/Hydra\">Hydra</a>.\n</p><p>You will meet <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf\">Dwarf</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Soldier\">Dwarf Soldier</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Guard\">Dwarf Guard</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Geomancer\">Dwarf Geomancers</a> in the mine. It is advisable to go in a group if you are a low level.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Hunting_tips\">Hunting tips</span></h2>\n<p><b>Mages</b>: they can hunt here from <a href=\"#/wiki/Level\">level</a> 25 and up if they do not go down to the rooms with <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Geomancer\">Dwarf Geomancers</a>. They should use a wand or rod that deals Death Damage, <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\">Fire Damage</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Damage\">Ice Damage</a> and use whatever strike spells that the dwarfs are weak against.<br/>\n<b><a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a></b>: they can hunt here from level 30 with around 60/50 skills to avoid too much of a risk and waste. Some decent equipment is required, like a <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Shield\">Dragon Shield</a> and preferable a Knight Set to be safe.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Dwarf Cave</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf\"><img alt=\"Dwarf\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dwarf_8e3a63.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf\">Dwarf</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">45</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">90</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">31 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-8× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Mushroom\">White Mushroom</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hatchet\">Hatchet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Axe\">Axe</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Copper%20Shield\">Copper Shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Pick\">Pick</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Leather%20Legs\">Leather Legs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Studded%20Armor\">Studded Armor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Letter\">Letter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarven%20Ring\">Dwarven Ring</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Iron%20Ore\">Iron Ore</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Soldier\"><img alt=\"Dwarf Soldier\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dwarf_Soldier_00bc31.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Soldier\">Dwarf Soldier</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">70</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">135</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">130 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-12× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></li>\n<li>0-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Mushroom\">White Mushroom</a></li>\n<li>0-7× <a href=\"#/wiki/Bolt\">Bolt</a></li>\n<li>Soldier Helmet</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">Shovel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Chain%20Armor\">Chain Armor</a></li>\n<li>0-3× Piercing Bolt (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarven%20Shield\">Dwarven Shield</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crossbow\">Crossbow</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Battle%20Axe\">Battle Axe</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Iron%20Ore\">Iron Ore</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Axe%20Ring\">Axe Ring</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Guard\"><img alt=\"Dwarf Guard\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dwarf_Guard_eca737.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Guard\">Dwarf Guard</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">165</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">245</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">140 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-30× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Leather%20Boots\">Leather Boots</a> (common)</li>\n<li>0-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Mushroom\">White Mushroom</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Scale%20Armor\">Scale Armor</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Battle Shield (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Battle%20Hammer\">Battle Hammer</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Helmet\">Steel Helmet</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Double%20Axe\">Double Axe</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Iron%20Ore\">Iron Ore</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Health%20Potion\">Health Potion</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Amethyst\">Small Amethyst</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Axe%20Ring\">Axe Ring</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Coal\">Coal</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Geomancer\"><img alt=\"Dwarf Geomancer\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dwarf_Geomancer_22d758.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Geomancer\">Dwarf Geomancer</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">265</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">380</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">210 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">100 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">110 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Earth Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_7605e0.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span>) + <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">80 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mana%20Drain\"><img alt=\"Mana Drain\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mana_Drain_Icon_a3e6f8.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-45× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blank%20Rune\">Blank Rune</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Pear (common)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Mushroom\">White Mushroom</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Light%20Wand\">Magic Light Wand</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Geomancer's Robe (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Geomancer's Staff (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Clerical Mace (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarven%20Ring\">Dwarven Ring</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Sapphire\">Small Sapphire</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Terra Boots (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Iron%20Ore\">Iron Ore</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Spellbook\">Spellbook</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Maps\">Maps</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Tiquanda Dwarf Cave 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"90\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tiquanda_Dwarf_Cave_1_8c1a53.png\" width=\"96\"/></span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Tiquanda Dwarf Cave 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"307\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tiquanda_Dwarf_Cave_2_d19537.png\" width=\"204\"/></span> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Tiquanda Dwarf Cave 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"302\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tiquanda_Dwarf_Cave_3_991401.png\" width=\"206\"/></span>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"4\">First Floor Respawns\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf\">Dwarves</a> and 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Soldier\">Dwarf Soldier</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"4\">Second Floor Respawns\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Total of 17 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf\">Dwarves</a>, 29 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Soldier\">Dwarf Soldiers</a> and 8 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Guard\">Dwarf Guards</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"4\">Third Floor Respawns\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>A\n</td>\n<td>2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Soldier\">Dwarf Soldiers</a> and 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Guard\">Dwarf Guards</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B\n</td>\n<td>5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Soldier\">Dwarf Soldiers</a> and 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Guard\">Dwarf Guards</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C\n</td>\n<td>3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Guard\">Dwarf Guards</a> and 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Geomancer\">Dwarf Geomancers</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>D\n</td>\n<td>4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Soldier\">Dwarf Soldiers</a>, 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Guard\">Dwarf Guards</a> and 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Geomancer\">Dwarf Geomancer</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Soldier\">Dwarf Soldiers</a>, 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Guard\">Dwarf Guards</a> and 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Geomancer\">Dwarf Geomancer</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"32pxd\"><img alt=\"32pxd\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Parchment_77aa91.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span><figcaption>32pxd</figcaption></figure><p><i>This  article is a stub. You can help TibiaWiki by expanding it.</i></p><p style=\"font-style:italic;font-size:x-small;\">Reasons for stub: knight strategy is missing, excluding the dwarf geomancer spots I think lvl 45 and skills 60/60 is good?</p></div></div>","quests":[]}